OL,4,CDerailed train caused #3.65m of damage 
OL,5,GDamage caused when a train derailed in 
OL,6,GEssex is estimated to have cost more   
OL,7,Gthan #3.6m to repair, it has been      
OL,8,Grevealed.                              
OL,10,FThe Greater Anglia service from        
OL,11,FSouthend Victoria to London Liverpool  
OL,12,FStreet came off the tracks about 2.1   
OL,13,Fmiles (3.4km) south of Wickford        
OL,14,Fstation on 14 August.                  
OL,16,FSixty-two passengers were on board the 
OL,17,Ftrain - which was travelling at 77mph  
OL,18,F(124km/h) - although nobody was        
OL,19,Finjured.                               
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
