OL,4,C'People are skint' so why is           
OL,5,Cwaterfront thriving?                   
OL,6,GThe owner of a craft beer business has 
OL,7,Gsaid running a new waterfront bar      
OL,8,G"feels really right".                  
OL,10,FHopsters, which already has a bar in   
OL,11,FFelixstowe's Beach Street, will be     
OL,12,Ftaking over the former Cult Cafe Bar   
OL,13,Fon the ground floor of the University  
OL,14,Fof Suffolk's James Hehir building in   
OL,15,FIpswich in January.                    
OL,17,FEd Barnes, who owns the bar, said:     
OL,18,F"Everyone's skint, everything's so     
OL,19,Fexpensive nowadays... if they're going 
OL,20,Fto spend their money, they're going to 
OL,21,Fmake sure it's something they really   
OL,22,Fenjoy."                           G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
