OL,4,CScience centre revamp will 'rocket     
OL,5,Cboost' economy                         
OL,6,GPlans to revamp a research institute   
OL,7,Ginto a #500m global science hub has    
OL,8,Greceived a major funding boost.        
OL,10,FAn extra #107m was recently announced  
OL,11,Fby the government towards the scheme   
OL,12,Fat the John Innes Centre (JIC) and The 
OL,13,FSainsbury Laboratory (TSL), at Norwich 
OL,14,FResearch Park.                         
OL,16,FIt is already a world-leading centre   
OL,17,Ffor plant and microbial science, but   
OL,18,Fthe project aims to transform parts of 
OL,19,Fthe site to streamline operations and  
OL,20,Fcreate state-of-the-art facilities.    
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
