OL,4,CNew homes pose sewage risk, warns      
OL,5,Cwater firm                             
OL,6,GA new housing estate would lead to an  
OL,7,G"unacceptable risk" of sewage flooding 
OL,8,Ginto a town, a water firm has warned.  
OL,10,FAnglian Water has told North Norfolk   
OL,11,FDistrict Council that its network      
OL,12,Fcould not cope with 150 homes being    
OL,13,Fbuilt in Stalham.                      
OL,15,FIts opposition has been backed by the  
OL,16,Ftown council which said there had been 
OL,17,Fseveral burst pipes in recent months   
OL,18,Fand it was "seriously concerned".      
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
